WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:07.802
In this video, you will vote for your favorite homes in a neighborhood contest, and see how voting works, so you know your vote counts.

00:00:07.802 --> 00:00:08.891
We start on the map.

00:00:09.795 --> 00:00:11.544
Start at SoCal Lights dot app.

00:00:13.413 --> 00:00:15.931
On the home page, tap Use my location.

00:00:17.686 --> 00:00:18.667
Then tap Allow.

00:00:22.630 --> 00:00:25.319
Now look at the top right corner of the map.

00:00:25.319 --> 00:00:26.515
See the three dots?

00:00:26.515 --> 00:00:30.817
That is the menu, and it is the doorway to everything else on the site.

00:00:30.817 --> 00:00:31.355
Tap them.

00:00:32.959 --> 00:00:34.772
In the menu, tap Contests.

00:00:36.448 --> 00:00:41.546
That is where every neighborhood contest lives: the ones you can vote in, enter, or run.

00:00:42.248 --> 00:00:45.085
Under Live now, find the contest, and tap Vote.

00:00:46.960 --> 00:00:49.695
The first time, the site asks you to sign in.

00:00:49.695 --> 00:00:53.381
That keeps it fair, with one vote per person in each category.

00:00:54.085 --> 00:00:57.118
Want to see the homes in person before you decide?

00:00:57.118 --> 00:00:58.367
Tap Visit the homes.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:01:03.898
It splits the homes into routes of nine stops or fewer, and sends each one to your maps app.

00:01:03.898 --> 00:01:08.954
Each route starts where the last one ended, and you can tick off each home as you go.

00:01:09.861 --> 00:01:10.806
Now the ballot.

00:01:10.806 --> 00:01:14.824
Every home is in every category, and you pick one favorite in each.

00:01:14.824 --> 00:01:17.720
Start with the first category, Best Traditional.

00:01:17.720 --> 00:01:20.911
Look through the homes, and tap Vote on your favorite.

00:01:22.840 --> 00:01:25.135
The next category opens by itself.

00:01:25.135 --> 00:01:29.987
In Most Creative, tap Vote on the display you think is the most inventive.

00:01:31.914 --> 00:01:33.489
And last, Best Animated.

00:01:33.489 --> 00:01:34.623
Tap your favorite.

00:01:37.043 --> 00:01:38.159
Thanks for voting!

00:01:38.159 --> 00:01:42.505
Your votes are saved, and you can change any of them until voting closes.

00:01:42.505 --> 00:01:44.561
You cannot vote for your own home.

00:01:44.561 --> 00:01:50.376
And tap Share this contest, to send it to a neighbor, because more votes make the contest more fun.

00:01:52.104 --> 00:01:53.917
Next up: Judge a contest.
